# PPSA16901: EULA gate, then select the ring's default item ("Lara's Home",
# TR1's playable mansion level) on the Tomb Raider I title screen.
#
# WHICH GAME THIS ARRIVES IN HAS CHANGED. When TOMB_RAIDER_STATUS.md was written (2026-08) this
# file arrived on Tomb Raider II, three runs of three. On 2026-10-06 it arrives on Tomb Raider I,
# on every build tried back to the v0.2.2 release, and Tomb Raider I's home renders as exploded
# geometry (#4637). For the scene the rung-3 claim is about use reach-tr2-laras-home.pad.
# The ring is a 5-item cycle with no New Game item on it (run05/run06), so this
# is the shortest route from a default launch to a real playable level.
6-14:down
16-18:cross
44-46:cross
52-54:cross
